<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dell EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dell EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it raised its earnings per share estimates on Dell Computer Corp for the next two fiscal years.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 estimate to $4.25 from $3.50.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1999 estimate to $5.25 from $4.15.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-5/8 to 73-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
